      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SKYBELLA (2) made a nice return in a higher-graded race last week, leading and fighting on well when just a head away in second at Kilmore. That was her first outing for seven months so it should have improved her and with the benefit of a good draw she can go one better. KEAYANG TWEETYBIRD (8) was rewarded for her recent consistency when she led and cruised home by 18m at Terang last time out. Should enjoy a pretty soft run from this draw, with the sprint lane in play. Could strike again. LEANNE LEEANN (1) gets the ace draw and must be considered after she finished third to KEAYANG TWEETYBIRD last start, her fourth placing from her last five outings. OFF YOUR FACESKI (3) hasn't been too far away of late and draws to be competitive while KYVALLEY ANTHONY (4) deserves respect after leading from this barrier to score at Geelong last week.",
